{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Commute by public transit",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Share of workers commuting by public transportation, pale yellow to dark green; the first class is deliberately narrow because most of the country has effectively none. Measured over all 32,798 ZIP Code Tabulation Areas with a published value: 6 classes with breaks at 0.5%/2%/5%/10%/25%, which fall at the 73rd/87th/94th/97th/99th percentile of the national distribution. 32.38% have a coefficient of variation above 0.3 and render faded \u2014 the estimate is real but its margin of error swamps it.",
